cks, white card)', roundphoto: 'Round photo with a color card (round photo, rings and dots, color card)', photopairs: 'Photo and words pairs (label, heading, photos each beside a words tile)', offsetphoto: 'Photo on two color blocks (label, big heading, words, button; every color your own)' })[b.type] || (aboutBlocks.SPECS[b.type] ? aboutBlocks.GROUP_NAMES[aboutBlocks.SPECS[b.type].group] + ': ' + aboutBlocks.SPECS[b.type].name : 'Photo + text') %></strong>
